## Introduction to three methods

In this lab, you will work with the three analytical methods introduced in the compendium:

-   **K-means cluster analysis**
-   **Linear regression**
-   **Logistic regression**

The main purpose of the lab is not to perform advanced statistical analysis. Instead, you will practice identifying **what type of analytical problem you are facing**, selecting an appropriate method, and discussing how the results could support a business decision.

Work in groups of **2–3 students**. Discuss each question before writing down your answer. You might not have time to go through all questions during the lab. We teachers would still encourage you do go through them all after the lab. Especially 'Part 6: Design your own business analytics problem' will be very relevant for the INL1 assignment.

